Instant application has been filed with prayer to to quash the impugned the charge-sheet No. 01;
dated 12.06.2023 in Case Crime No. 0147/2021 Under Section(s) 363, 366, 504, 506, 427 IPC and Sections 3(1)(da) 3(1)(dha), 3(2)(v) 3(2)(va), 376 IPC and Sections 3 and 4 of Penetrative Sexual Assault-POCSO Act-2012 and against the petitioners pending before Learned Special Court (POCSO Act) and further prayer is to stay the proceedings of the case initiated in the impugned chargesheet no. 01 of 2021 dated 12.06.2023 in Case Crime No. 147 of 2021 under sections 363, 366, 504, 506,
427 IPC and Sections 3(1)(da) 3(1)(dha), 3(2)(v) 3(2)(va), 376 IPC and Sections 3 and 4 of Penetrative Sexual Assault-POCSO Act.
